u015fiycik olmaz mainden [USERNAME_5859] listesini kopyalay\u0131p koyar\u0131m sonra. [PERSON_NAME_123977] \u00e7al\u0131\u015fal\u0131m \u015fu an", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/152", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "471a10cc1558de96b23e5adc5c8d1d00", "ts": "1754561163.470499", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Algo levelleri i\u00e7in falan diyorsun de\u011fil mi?", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/155", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "4afc301a0d20456295266431d29b3dac", "ts": "1754561271.740229", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Deftere yazd\u0131m, d\u00fczelticem mutlaka", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/157", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "f0da3385769bd33081b0b0366dbcb3c6", "ts": "1754561307.303219", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Deftere [USERNAME_3085] unutuyorum napiim sa\u015flkd\u015fasd", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "laughing", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/159", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2c970ac4b370ed12d955010b69f3eebd", "ts": "1754562475.712989", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[USERNAME_3086] bakt\u0131m hay\u0131r \u00e7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yor", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/160", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "b68eebc8505c3f479f8c60ac52016257", "ts": "1754562486.332499", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "D\u00fcn gece \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yordu", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/166", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "acf874f8b8955458eadfa903fe603940", "ts": "1754565128.218469", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Ne olmu\u015f?", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": "1754563442.630979", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/167", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0b7e5035c4e15b390e113816f1bdb8c5", "ts": "1754565140.873769", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "fena de\u011fil. Zombinin HPsini [USERNAME_3088]", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/168", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "ffb46cc57d70382e9fc0f8cba475003f", "ts": "1754565151.570839", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Ya da item azaltabilirsin", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/169", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7c22130c5a9524216d56d261c110e6eb", "ts": "1754565167.261429", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "O kadar \u00f6nemli de\u011fil 1-2 item learning curve i\u00e7in", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/172", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "712e0fc70b1e2bf3dd2c872f37ed314a", "ts": "1754565219.326869", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "hi\u00e7bir \u015fey anlamad\u0131m o zaman. \u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yordu zaten [USERNAME_3090]", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": "1754563442.630979", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/176", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0319b0257e90c2d5dc5102e4b0102416", "ts": "1754565291.420829", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Onu yapamayiz o y\u00fczden zombi spawn zaman\u0131ni micromanage edelim dedim. Oynayamayan zaten failler monetize olur. Oynayabilen de spawn zaman\u0131 engeline tak\u0131lir kolay ge\u00e7tim hissi, metriklerde playtime oynamaz", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/178", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e39956d50858ea690c9c2dda0243f33a", "ts": "1754565324.246359", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "dene \u015fans\u0131n\u0131 bence ilk efekt introduction, daha iyi olacak diyorsan", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/CC43664F351E/2025-08.json", "pointer": "/181", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "251803ab55f81af862cc5eeb9a05d6d3", "ts": "1754576656.720699", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "\u0130lk boss chef yapabiliriz", "channel": "CC43664F351E", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false,